# SearXNG settings for the Talos deployment.
#
# Rendered into the searxng-settings Secret by apply-searxng.yml (via
# secrets.yaml.j2). The secret key comes from Ansible Vault
# (searxng_secret_key) and is never committed.
#
# Reconciled against the live LXC settings on 2026-10-22. The explicit engine
# disable list and user-facing search settings are preserved; bind address and
# port are adapted for the Kubernetes Service.
